ati Temple.\nInfrastructure & Facilities:')], 'answer': "Nice to meet you, Srinu! As I mentioned earlier, I am RGUKT InfoGuru, the official virtual assistant for RGUKT Basar. I'm here to help you with any questions or concerns you may have related to RGUKT or its various departments, including the Publications and Public Relations (PPR) Office, Finance & Accounts, and the Placement Cell. Feel free to ask me anything, and I'll do my best to provide you with accurate and helpful information!"}
