The department focuses on research and development, fostering innovative ideas, and publishing papers and awards. The department also emphasizes holistic development through various activities for both staff and students.

The vision of the department is to be a globally recognized center for excellence in Computer Science & Engineering education and research, catering to the current needs of the industry and society by producing globally competent and quality computer professionals.

The mission of the department includes:

1. To produce computer science graduates with sound subject knowledge, certified skill-sets, and the ability to address professional challenges.
2. To strengthen department interaction with multinational companies to stay abreast of technological advancements, providing students with opportunities to work with recent tools and technologies.
3. To foster professional behavior and leadership abilities, instilling commitment to work culture for national progress, while upholding ethical, moral, and human values.
4. To provide practical exposure in various domain areas and undertake research and development activities.
5. To develop entrepreneurship and managerial abilities through world-class engineering and management education.

The HOD's message welcomes students to the creative world of CSE and emphasizes the department's focus on academic excellence, research, and innovation.

The department has a team of faculty members, including:

1. A. Sreedhar - M. Tech
2. K. Rajitha - M.Sc, PGDIT
