                              'For any further information or clarification, '
                              'please feel free to ask.',
                   'role': 'assistant'},
                  {'content': 'Give me details of rgukt basar', 'role': 'user'},
                  {'content': 'Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge '
                              'Technologies (RGUKT) Basar is a university '
                              'located in Basar, Nirmal district, Telangana, '
                              'India. Here are some details about the '
                              'university:\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Establishment:**\n'
                              'RGUKT Basar was established in 2008 by the '
                              'Government of Andhra Pradesh (now Telangana) as '
                              'a full-fledged university.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Objective:**\n'
                              'The primary objective of the university is to '
                              'provide high-quality educational opportunities '
                              'to talented rural youth, primarily from '
                              'Telangana and Andhra Pradesh.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Background:**\n'
                              'The first batch of 6,000 students was admitted '
                              'to a six-year integrated program in August '
                              '2008. Following the bifurcation of Andhra '
                              'Pradesh in 2015, the campuses were divided '
                              'between Telangana and Andhra Pradesh. '
                              'Currently, the Basar campus is the only one '
                              'operational in Telangana.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Educational Objectives:**\n'
                              'The primary objective of RGUKT Basar is to '
                              'provide high-quality education to rural youth, '
                              'initially targeting the top 1% of students from '
                              'rural X class (tenth grade).\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Course Structure:**\n'
                              'RGUKT admits 1,000 students annually into the '
                              'PUC (Pre-University Course) as part of a '
                              'six-year integrated program culminating in a '
                              'B.Tech. degree. The focus is on providing '
                              'modern educational techniques that integrate '
                              'cognitive science tools, such as "Learning by '
                              'Example," "Learning by Doing," "Problem-Based '
                              'Learning," and "Self-Paced Learning."\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Key Features:**\n'
                              '\n'
                              '* Laptop Distribution: Every student is '
                              'provided with a personal laptop, ensuring '
                              'uninterrupted access to learning resources.\n'
                              '* Core Values:\n'
                              '\t+ Integrity\n'
                              '\t+ Respect for all\n'
                              '\t+ Care for the environment\n'
                              '* Emerging Fields:\n'
                              '\t+ RGUKT focuses on advancing knowledge in '
                              'emerging fields such as Information Technology, '
                              'Nanotechnology, Cloud Computing, Data '
                              'Analytics, and the Internet of Things (IoT).\n'
                              '* Broad-Based Education:\n'
                              '\t+ Offers integrated courses in Humanities, '
                              'Social Sciences, and other interdisciplinary '
                              'areas, with an emphasis on soft skills.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Vision:**\n'
                              "The university's vision is to provide "
                              'world-class engineering education to rural '
                              'youth, particularly those deprived of '
                              'opportunities to attend renowned institutions.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Mission:**\n'
                              "The university's mission is to produce globally "
                              'competent and quality computer professionals '
                              'who can address the current and future needs of '
                              'the industry and society.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Facilities:**\n'
                              '\n'
                              '* Well-equipped laboratories and workshops\n'
                              '* State-of-the-art infrastructure and '
                              'amenities\n'
                              '* Highly qualified faculty members\n'
                              '* Modern IT tools and resources\n'
                              '* Library and learning resources center\n'
                              '* Sports and recreational facilities\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**Departments:**\n'
                              'RGUKT Basar has several departments, '
                              'including:\n'
                              '\n'
                              '* Department of Civil Engineering\n'
                              '* Department of Computer Science and '
                              'Engineering\n'
                              '* Department of Electrical Engineering\n'
                              '* Department of Mechanical Engineering\n'
                              '* Department of Electronics and Communication '
                              'Engineering\n'
                              '\n'
                              'These are some of the details about RGUKT '
                              'Basar. If you have any specific questions or '
                              'need further clarification, please feel free to '
                              'ask!',
                   'role': 'assistant'},
                  {'content': 'Provide me the Grading criteria in exams',
                   'role': 'user'},
                  {'content': "According to the RGUKT Basar's guidelines, the "
                              'grading criteria for exams are as follows:\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**PUC Program (6-year Integrated Course)**\n'
                              '\n'
                              '* For students admitted from the academic year '
                              '2016-17:\n'
                              '\t+ Theory subjects: 40% marks in end semester '
                              'examination and an overall of minimum 40% marks '
