                              '| 2 | Very Good | 80-89 | A | 9 |\n'
                              '| 3 | Good | 70-79 | B | 8 |\n'
                              '| 4 | Fair | 60-69 | C | 7 |\n'
                              '| 5 | Average | 50-59 | D | 6 |\n'
                              '| 6 | Pass | 40-49 | P | 5 |\n'
                              '| 7 | Remedial/Fail | < 40 | R | 0 |\n'
                              '\n'
                              'The highest possible CGPA (Cumulative Grade '
                              'Point Average) in the system is 10.00.\n'
                              '\n'
                              '**End Semester Examination (ESE) and Continuous '
                              'Internal Evaluation (CIE)**\n'
                              '\n'
                              '* Each theory subject: 40 internal marks (out '
                              'of which 10 marks are for '
                              'assignments/tutorials/quizzes, etc.) and 60 '
                              'marks for the end semester examination.\n'
                              '* Each laboratory subject: 50 internal marks '
                              'and 50 marks for the end semester examination.\n'
                              '* Each drawing subject/lab: 50 internal marks '
                              'and 50 marks for the end semester examination.\n'
