2025-04-12 16:20:05,692 - INFO - chat_app.services.impl.chat_service_impl - chat_service_impl.generate_response:60 - Response answer from the agent: According to the provided context, the grading criteria for the PUC program of the 6-year integrated course at RGUKT Basar are as follows:

**PUC Program Grading Criteria:**

