2025-04-12 17:31:17,588 - INFO - chat_app.services.impl.chat_service_impl - chat_service_impl.generate_response:60 - Response answer from the agent: Here are some key details about Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies (RGUKT) Basar:

**Establishment:** RGUKT Basar was established by the Government of Andhra Pradesh in 2008 as a full-fledged university.

**Objective:** The university was created to provide high-quality educational opportunities to talented rural youth, primarily from Telangana and Andhra Pradesh.

**Background:**

* The first batch of 6,000 students was admitted to a six-year integrated program in August 2008.
* Following the bifurcation of Andhra Pradesh in 2015, the campuses were divided between Telangana and Andhra Pradesh.
* Currently, the Basar campus is the only one operational in Telangana.

**Educational Objectives:**

* Primary Objective: Provide high-quality education to rural youth, initially targeting the top 1% of students from rural X class (tenth grade).
* Course Structure: RGUKT admits 1,000 students annually into the PUC (Pre-University Course) as part of a six-year integrated program culminating in a B.Tech. degree.
* Focus on modern educational techniques such as "Learning by Example," "Learning by Doing," "Problem-Based Learning," and "Self-Paced Learning."

**Key Features:**

* Laptop Distribution: Every student is provided with a personal laptop, ensuring uninterrupted access to learning resources.
* Core Values: Integrity, Respect for all, and Care for the environment.
* Emerging Fields: RGUKT focuses on advancing knowledge in emerging fields such as Information Technology, Nanotechnology, Cloud Computing, Data Analytics, and the Internet of Things (IoT).
* Broad-Based Education: Offers integrated courses in Humanities, Social Sciences, and other interdisciplinary areas, with an emphasis on soft skills.

**Vision:**

* Mission: The university's vision is to provide world-class engineering education to rural youth, particularly those deprived of opportunities to attend renowned institutions.

**Contact Information:**

* Email: [careers@rgukt.ac.in](mailto:careers@rgukt.ac.in)
* Finance & Accounts:
	+ Shri G. Aneel Reddy ñ Finance Officer (I/c) (Department: Finance & Accounts)
	+ Email: [fo@rgukt.ac.in](mailto:fo@rgukt.ac.in)
	+ M. Srinivas ñ Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)
	+ Email: [mittapellisrinivas@rgukt.ac.in](mailto:mittapellisrinivas@rgukt.ac.in)
	+ Jayaraju Paramalla ñ Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)
	+ Email: [jayaraju.peramalla@rgukt.ac.in](mailto:jayaraju.peramalla@rgukt.ac.in)

**Publications and Public Relations (PPR) Office:**

* Responsible for disseminating information related to academics, research, campus events, and achievements.
* Coordinates with various departments to provide updates and maintain an efficient communication framework within the institution.

I hope this information helps! Let me know if you have any further questions.
