password = "your_email_password"

send_email(subject, message, from_addr, to_addr, password)
```

Please note that the above code assumes that you're using Gmail to send the email. You'll need to replace `'smtp.gmail.com'` with the SMTP server of your email provider. Also, you'll need to enable less secure apps in your Gmail account settings.

Here's an example of how to send an email using the `yagmail` library, which is a wrapper around `smtplib`:

```
