 of subjects registered for the semester. \n \nï Calculation of CGPA  \n A Cumulative Grade Point Average (CGPA) will be computed f or every student at the end of each semester. \nThe CGPA would give the cumulative performance of a stu dent from the first semester upto the end of the \nsemester to which it refers and calculated as follows."),
